          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "html": "See <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bar_Crawl_(miniquest)#Visiting_the_bars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this section of the full guide</a> to better understand what ales/beers have what effects on you. It includes the specific drink names, photos, and other helpful info."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<b>If you lose/drop your barcrawl card, you will have to start the entire miniquest all over again.</b>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "You can visit the bars in any order. None of the beers are physical items, they&#39;re consumed automatically. You can use the barcrawl card on the bartenders to skip the dialogue options."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "visiting-the-bars:ykacdr",
          "html": "Go to the 1<sup>st</sup> floor (UK) / 2<sup>nd</sup> floor (US) of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Tree</a> and talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blurberry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blurberry</a>. You can use <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Home_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Home Teleport</a> to Al Kharid and then take the Gnome Glider to the Tree Gnome Stronghold, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne lodestone</a> and run north-west, or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Eagles%27_Peak_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eagles&#39; Peak lodestone</a> with 61 Agility and head east.",
          "text": "Go to the 1st floor (UK) / 2nd floor (US) of the Grand Tree and talk to Blurberry. You can use Home Teleport to Al Kharid and then take the Gnome Glider to the Tree Gnome Stronghold, Ardougne lodestone and run north-west, or Eagles' Peak lodestone with 61 Agility and head east.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "~",
                  "text": "[Any option]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "visiting-the-bars:mxr0x1",
